{
  "apis": [
    {
      "name": "经营利润报表-ASIN毛利率（bd/profit/asin/list）",
      "kind": "web",
      "url": "https://gw.lingxingerp.com/bd/profit/report/report/asin/list",
      "method": "POST",
      "params": {
        "startDate": "2026-09-20",
        "endDate": "2026-09-20",
        "offset": 0,
        "length": 100,
        "mids": [1],
        "sids": [],
        "currencyCode": "",
        "cids": [],
        "bids": [],
        "principalUids": [],
        "productDeveloperUids": [],
        "searchField": "asin",
        "searchValue": [],
        "sortField": "grossProfit",
        "sortType": "desc",
        "isDisplayByDate": "",
        "version": "",
        "listingTagIds": [],
        "isMonthly": false,
        "orderStatus": "Disbursed",
        "transactionStatus": []
      },
      "description": "自动补货-经营利润报表：按 ASIN 取毛利率 grossRate（落 profit_report_stats）。单日口径 startDate=endDate，需随调用日期覆盖（写死会查不到数据）；分页 offset/length，offset+length ≥ data.total 即取全量；orderStatus=Disbursed 为已结算口径；字段 grossRate 为 0~1 小数（如 0.3806=38.06%）；返回 code==0 才算成功；req_time_sequence 防重放序列可省略或动态生成。请求头由代理服务自动注入（auth-token/x-ak-company-id/x-ak-uid 等），无需填写。"
    },
    {
